# Files kept in the GitHub repository but left OUT of the Comfy Registry
# package. `comfy node publish` zips the git-tracked files and drops every
# path matched here (gitwildmatch, same syntax as .gitignore).
#
# The registry scans each published version with YARA rules. The test suite
# runs node.js harnesses and lifts functions out of source with exec() --
# legitimate in a test, but it is ~100 files of subprocess/exec that a
# ComfyUI user never needs and a scanner cannot tell apart from the real
# thing. tools/ holds developer-only browser probes (Playwright).
#
# Both stay in the repository for anyone who wants to verify the pack.

tests/
tools/
